1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,925
Persona 6 Finally Revealed After 10-Year Wait.

2
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:12,025
After a decade-long wait, Atlus finally unveiled Persona 6 at the Xbox Games Showcase on June 8, 2026.

3
00:00:12,025 --> 00:00:23,037
The teaser trailer was short but striking: a foggy graveyard filled with tombstones, dead trees, and flashes of green lightning, ending with the Persona 6 logo in an eerie green hue.

4
00:00:23,037 --> 00:00:30,900
Green becomes the series signature color, following blues Persona 3, yellows Persona 4, and reds Persona 5.

5
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:37,787
The setting is a modern Japanese town where players will experience dual school life and supernatural urban legends.

6
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:44,375
The game is coming to PS5 Xbox Series X|S and PC and will launch day one on Game Pass.

7
00:00:44,375 --> 00:00:50,812
No release date has been announced yet Persona 4 Revival is scheduled for February 2027 first.

8
00:00:50,812 --> 00:00:56,137
Series director Kazuhisa Wada confirmed the team is working hard on the title.

9
00:00:56,137 --> 00:01:05,075
Fans have already sparked countless theories about the graveyard imagery with many speculating that Persona awakening might involve death or resurrection this time.

